---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Guidelines | Shellui
description: Brand, foundations, writing, interface, and print rules for Shellui. Versioned markdown that agents and humans share.
hideBreadcrumbs: true
---

<article class="page-top page-x pb-20">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl">
    {% include "guidelines-subnav.njk" %}

    <header>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 md:text-5xl dark:text-white">Guidelines</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-lg text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
        What Shellui sounds and looks like. One topic per page, each with a markdown twin for agents. Tokens live in Foundations; logos and kit files live under Brand downloads.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">
        Guidelines v2.0.0 · <a href="/guidelines/changelog/" class="text-primary-ink underline hover:opacity-90">Changelog</a>
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
      {% for item in guidelines.topics %}
        {% if item.slug != 'changelog' %}
          <a href="{{ item.href }}" class="group flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 p-6 transition hover:border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-800 dark:hover:border-gray-700">
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
              <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">{{ item.navLabel }}</h2>
              <span class="shrink-0 rounded-full border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium tabular-nums text-gray-700 dark:border-gray-800 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-gray-300">v{{ item.version }}</span>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">{{ item.hubDescription }}</p>
            {% if item.agentAliasUrl %}
              <p class="mt-3 font-mono text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">fetch https://shellui.com{{ item.agentAliasUrl }}</p>
            {% endif %}
            <span class="mt-4 text-sm font-semibold text-primary-ink group-hover:underline">Read {{ item.navLabel | lower }}</span>
          </a>
        {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50 p-6 dark:border-gray-800 dark:bg-white/5">
      <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">For agents</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 max-w-3xl text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
        Index: <a href="/llms.txt" class="font-medium text-primary-ink">/llms.txt</a>.
        Full corpus: <a href="/llms-full.txt" class="font-medium text-primary-ink">/llms-full.txt</a>.
        Building a page? Fetch <a href="/design.md" class="font-medium text-primary-ink">/design.md</a> first, then the topic markdown. Do not scrape HTML.
      </p>
      <pre class="mt-4 overflow-x-auto rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-white px-4 py-3 font-mono text-xs leading-relaxed text-gray-800 dark:border-gray-800 dark:bg-gray-950 dark:text-gray-200"># 1. Composition alias
https://shellui.com/design.md

# 2. Parent skill (shellui/skills repo)
{{ guidelines.parentSkillPath }}</pre>
      <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5 text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
        {% for item in guidelines.topics %}
          {% if item.slug != 'changelog' %}
            <li>
              <span class="font-medium text-gray-900 dark:text-white">{{ item.navLabel }}</span>:
              <code class="font-mono text-[0.8rem]">{{ item.sourcePath }}</code>
              →
              <code class="font-mono text-[0.8rem]">https://shellui.com{{ item.downloadUrl }}</code>
            </li>
          {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</article>
